%% Approved Parts to Buy and stock reservation flow is documented in inventory-lifecycle.mmd.
flowchart TD
    A[ServiceOrder part requirement] --> B[Parts to Buy shows uncovered demand]
    B --> C[Operator purchases outside the application]
    C --> D[Operator records stock replenishment in Stock module]
    D --> E[Increase on-hand and available quantity]
    E --> F[Parts to Buy recalculates automatically]
    F --> G{Operator explicitly reserves stock?}
    G -- No --> H[Stock remains available]
    G -- Yes --> I[Fresh employee authentication]
    I --> J[Atomically reserve up to available quantity]
    J --> K[Full or partial reservation]
    K --> L{All blocking requirements fully reserved?}
    L -- No --> M[ServiceOrder remains AWAITING_PARTS]
    L -- Yes --> N[Explicit employee-authenticated Resume action]
